ht|n|at|^*GA1,1.  You want to have your Aces capture Kings and Queens if at all possible^*N|
                  
ht|o|at|^*GA2,2.  5 level decisions in a competitive auction are extremely difficult^*N|
                  
ht|p|at|^*GA3,3.  Responding to a takeout double^*N|
                  
ht|q|at|^*GA4,4.  Nice 14 hand^*N|
                  
ht|r|at|^*GA5,5.  When should you prefer bidding 5 of a minor instead of 3N^*N|
                  
ht|s|at|^*GA6,6.  A good recovery^*N|


