UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Once again proving "the 5 level belongs to the opponents" is a good rule but hard to follow often. Our 5@H is down 1 assuming they take their 2 diamonds and 1 spade right away.|
PG| ***** 28 ***** |


