mb|P|mb|1H|mb|P|mb|1N|mb|P|mb|2C|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|1N is forcing in 2/1 and North bid is 2@C which only promises a 3-card suit support.|
