UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|North should absolutely not bid 3N. The hand needs at least a nice 14. Granted you can add 1 point for the quality heart suit and 1 point for the 5 hearts which gets you to 14 but it is not a ^*BNice 14^*n.|
