mb|1H|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|3N|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|West has no good bid. 1N is way too weak, as is 2N. It is possible but unlikely they have slam because once I bid 1@H, West's hearts are not worth as much. So 3N is a good practical call, as it is very likely to be their best spot.|
