UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Bad club break was unlucky but good recovery. When planning the hand, West can count 3 clubs at least, 2 spades, and 3 hearts. So needs one more tricks. Possibilities are hearts (if they are 3-3 or the Jack drops). And a diamond if the @DA is onside. It turned out both worked.|
